events.jsonl.lock

# Agent-run documentation artifacts. A coordination run writes markdown
# summaries into the working tree; these are generated output, not source, and
# a directory-scoped `git add src/ tests/` will sweep them into a commit.
#
# Deliberately name-based, not `**/*.md`: the DOX tree (49 tracked
# `AGENTS.md` files) and the hand-authored prompt assets under
# `src/orchestrator/` are markdown that MUST stay trackable.
# Anchored to the two directories an agent run actually writes into, and to
# the exact artifact names observed. An earlier draft used `**/tui.md` and
# `**/tests.md`, which would silently untrack a legitimate `docs/tui.md`.
/project.md
src/project.md
src/**/ARTIFACT_SUMMARY.md
src/**/tui.md
tests/**/tests.md
tests/final-report.md
